ed stock units:</span></div><div style="margin-bottom:10pt;text-align:center"><table style="border-collapse:collapse;display:inline-table;margin-bottom:5pt;vertical-align:text-bottom;width:75.416%"><tr><td style="width:1.0%"/><td style="width:65.382%"/><td style="width:0.1%"/><td style="width:0.1%"/><td style="width:0.536%"/><td style="width:0.1%"/><td style="width:1.0%"/><td style="width:14.922%"/><td style="width:0.1%"/><td style="width:0.1%"/><td style="width:0.536%"/><td style="width:0.1%"/><td style="width:1.0%"/><td style="width:14.924%"/><td style="width:0.1%"/></tr><tr><td colspan="3" style="background-color:#ffffff;padding:2.62pt 1pt 1.5pt 1pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:bottom"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%">Restricted Stock Units</span></td><td colspan="3" style="background-color:#ffffff;padding:0 1pt"/><td colspan="3" style="background-color:#ffffff;padding:2.62pt 1pt 1.5pt 1pt;text-align:center;vertical-align:bottom"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%">Number<br/>of Units</span></td><td colspan="3" style="background-color:#ffffff;padding:0 1pt"/><td colspan="3" style="background-color:#ffffff;padding:2.62pt 1pt 1.5pt 1pt;text-align:center;vertical-align:bottom"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%">Weighted<br/>Average<br/>Grant Date<br/>Fair Value</span></td></tr><tr><td colspan="3" style="background-color:#cceeff;border-top:0.75pt solid #000000;padding:2.62pt 1pt 1.5pt 1pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:bottom"><div><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">Unvested units outstanding, January 1, 2026</span></div></td><td colspan="3" style="background-color:#cceeff;padding:0 1pt"/><td colspan="2" style="background-color:#cceeff;border-top:0.75pt solid #000000;padding:2.62pt